          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bedeckt is the participle of bedecken 'to cover', from decken, inherited from Old High German decchen and Proto-Germanic þakjaną (EtymDB), the root of Dach 'roof'."
            }
